      "text": "1. This application under Section 439 of the Cr.P.C. has been filed by the petitioner in connection with Nalco Township P.S. Case No. 155 of 2023 corresponding to G.R. case No. 718 of 2024 in the Court of learned J.M.F.C., Banarpal, where preliminary charge sheet has been submitted under Sections 365, 366, 370(4), 376-D, 376, 109, 506, 34 of IPC, keeping investigation open.",
