      "summary_sent_score": 0.10391365736722946
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "4. The prosecution allegation in brief against the petitioner is that on 21.08.2023 at about 8.35 p.m.\nwhile informant along with victim were returning to her village-Balanda at that time, four persons came in a bike and detained their auto near Kurudol Hanuman temple and forcibly took away the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1077,
      "end": 1381,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "21.08.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
