      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22354860603809357
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "On the basis of the report of the informant, the IIC, Nalco Township P.S. Case No. 155 dated 22.08.2023 and conducted investigation. During investigation, it came to light that the informant is involved in this case for kidnapping the victim and the petitioner had committed rape on her along with some of the other accused persons, for which they were also arrested.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
