      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "5. Mr. Amit Kumar Nath, learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the petitioner has not been named in the FIR, but he has been arrested subsequently in the case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2143,
      "end": 2311,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Amit Kumar Nath",
          "label": "LAWYER",
