      "text": "He also submits that BLAPL No. 2023 of 2024, BLAPL No. 1878 of 2024 and BLAPL No. 574 of 2024 filed by the co-accused have been rejected by this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
